## Delegation

Use native subagents without asking when that reduces wall-clock time or keeps the main context
clean — sizeable, self-contained, independently verifiable work only, never work you can finish in
a few tool calls. Lanes: Sonnet for routine exploration and bounded implementation, Opus for
integration and difficult judgment, Fable only for genuinely ambiguous, high-risk or long-horizon
problems — details in each agent's `description:` under `agent-config/agents/`.
A subagent's final message is the only thing that reaches you, so require the result in it.
Run independent work asynchronously.
